      "blob_url": "https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/f2d9558cb80168423ba90aa074b75c2f8658a0c7/Misc%2FNEWS.d%2Fnext%2FCore_and_Builtins%2F2025-12-27-10-14-26.gh-issue-143195.MNldfr.rst",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/python/cpython/raw/f2d9558cb80168423ba90aa074b75c2f8658a0c7/Misc%2FNEWS.d%2Fnext%2FCore_and_Builtins%2F2025-12-27-10-14-26.gh-issue-143195.MNldfr.rst",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/contents/Misc%2FNEWS.d%2Fnext%2FCore_and_Builtins%2F2025-12-27-10-14-26.gh-issue-143195.MNldfr.rst?ref=f2d9558cb80168423ba90aa074b75c2f8658a0c7",
      "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Fix use-after-free crashes in :meth:`bytearray.hex` and :meth:`memoryview.hex`\n+when the separator's :meth:`~object.__len__` mutates the original object.\n+Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
    },
    {
      "sha": "8a454aa48a09300b0864a93d0b8d6e3b9751685c",
      "filename": "Objects/bytearrayobject.c",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 7,
      "deletions": 1,
      "changes": 8,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/f2d9558cb80168423ba90aa074b75c2f8658a0c7/Objects%2Fbytearrayobject.c",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/python/cpython/raw/f2d9558cb80168423ba90aa074b75c2f8658a0c7/Objects%2Fbytearrayobject.c",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/contents/Objects%2Fbytearrayobject.c?ref=f2d9558cb80168423ba90aa074b75c2f8658a0c7",
      "patch": "@@ -2664,7 +2664,13 @@ bytearray_hex_impl(PyByteArrayObject *self, PyObject *sep, int bytes_per_sep)\n {\n     char* argbuf = PyByteArray_AS_STRING(self);\n     Py_ssize_t arglen = PyByteArray_GET_SIZE(self);\n-    return _Py_strhex_with_sep(argbuf, arglen, sep, bytes_per_sep);\n+    // Prevent 'self' from being freed if computing len(sep) mutates 'self'\n+    // in _Py_strhex_with_sep().\n+    // See: https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/143195.\n+    self->ob_exports++;\n+    PyObject *res = _Py_strhex_with_sep(argbuf, arglen, sep, bytes_per_sep);\n+    self->ob_exports--;\n+    return res;\n }\n \n static PyObject *"
    },
